id now what is valid is  to protect our  people to protect the gains we have had  to protect the freedoms of our people  injuries and the infrastructure what's  happening now  the space is being dealt with  in a way that is in disadvantage of our  people and its future  infrastructure is blowing up population  civilian population are  made human shield and they are losing  and suffering their life  change that is the situation on the  ground and people on the ground in  afghanistan seem to be losing hope  up in this whole process that there is  going to be intra-afghan dialogue there  is going to be some sort of an agreement  between the taliban and the afghan  government  where the taliban seem to have the  momentum behind them as the foreign  forces are pulling out they are taking  more territories  do you fear that the afghan government  is losing  its grip as there's lots of talk about  uh the government collapsing maybe in a  matter of months  well this kind of assessment of being  there  long time ago throughout the past 20  years there's been number of  intelligence report that always have  been  making assessment and predictions of  course they may look to some of the  indicators they do not look to the other  indicators  a lot of people are up there taking arms  and asking the government to allow them  to fight against the taliban it's a  popular  kind of reaction to the type of  militarism  and and a military  push for taking over territory that's an  indicator that one need to  take into consideration the other key  indicators wherever there is a fight and  there is a district that has fallen  you see a massive number of population  leaving that district and moving to the  area where the government is  it's a clear indicator that people don't  want to  live under that kind of circumstances  why they don't go  a district down where the taliban  already had a control they decided to  come to the government area  now making a judgment that the  government wo